NewsAgent

As an admin I want to create news agent role to handle expension of personal
As an admin I want to read existing news agents to be able to keep track of them for security reasons
As an admin I want to update existing news agents to update any changes in information
As an admin I want to delete news agents in case anyone is fired or retired.

Delivery Area

As a news agent I want to create address and classify them in delivery areas to organise deliveries more effectively.
As a news agent I want to read addresses and delivery areas so I know where to send delivery persons
As a news agent I want to update delivery areas and orders so that the system remains accurate when customers are moved or new customers are added
As a news agent I want to delete delivery areas or addresses in case of cancelations of service
As a news agent I want to print delivery list in order, so that each delivery person knows which publications to deliver to each address

Acceptance Criteria

NewsAgent
1. Admin enters all required details and creates a news agent, then the news agent will be added to the system.
The news agent will have a unique id.
Required fields such as name, address and contact details must not be empty.
The system should display a confirmation alert when the news agent is successfully created.
Invalid information should display an error alert.

2. Admin selects an existing news agent, then their details are displayed.
The displayed information should include id, name, address and contact details.
The details displayed must match the information stored in the system.
If the news agent does not exist, the system should display an error alert.

3. Admin selects a news agent and edits their details, then the updated information is saved.
The system has to allow changes to the news agent's details.
Required fields must not be empty when updating the information.
The updated details should be displayed when the news agent is selected again.
The system should display a confirmation alert to confirm that the update was successful.
Invalid information should display an error alert.

4. Admin selects a news agent's account to delete.
A confirmation message should display to confirm the deletion.
The deleted news agent should no longer appear in the system.
The system should display confirmation that the news agent was successfully deleted.
If the admin tries to delete a news agent who does not exist, an error message should display.

Delivery Area
1. Admin enters all required address details and creates an address, then the address will be added to the system.
The address will have a unique id.
Required fields such as address, town and delivery area must not be empty.
The news agent should be able to assign the address to an existing delivery area.
The system should display a confirmation alert when the address is successfully created.
Invalid information should display an error alert.

Delivery list should be displayed according to their assigned delivery order.
Each address will assigned to id that linked to specific areas
